<h2 style="color: #00209F; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 5px;">
  BonID disponib nan <%= @commune_name %>!
</h2>
<p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0;">BonID is now live in <%= @commune_name %>! &middot; BonID est maintenant disponible a <%= @commune_name %>!</p>

<p>
  Bon nouvèl! BonID lanse ofisyèlman nan <strong><%= @commune_name %></strong>.
  Ou te sou lis datant lan — kounye a ou ka kreye kont ou dirèkteman, san kòd envitasyon.
</p>

<div style="background: #111827; border-radius: 12px; padding: 25px; margin: 25px 0; color: #fff; text-align: center;">
  <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 16px;">Kont ou pare pou kreye</p>

  <a href="<%= @register_url %>"
     style="display: inline-block; background: #22c55e; color: #fff !important; padding: 14px 35px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">
    Kreye Kont Mwen
  </a>
</div>

<div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; color: #374151;">
    <strong>Kisa BonID ye?</strong> Premye idantite dijital sekirize Ayiti.
    Ou gen kontwol total sou enfomasyon ou. Ou ka we ki kote yo te itilize l,
    epi ou pataje selman sa ou vle pataje.
  </p>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">
  <strong>English:</strong> Great news — BonID is now live in <%= @commune_name %>! You were on the
  waitlist, and you can now create your account directly, no invite code needed. BonID is Haiti's first
  secure digital identity. You'll have full control over your information, see where it was used, and
  share only what you want.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">
  <strong>Francais:</strong> Bonne nouvelle — BonID est maintenant disponible a <%= @commune_name %>!
  Vous etiez sur la liste d'attente, et vous pouvez desormais creer votre compte directement, sans code
  d'invitation. BonID est la premiere identite numerique securisee d'Haiti.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #999; margin-top: 20px;">
  Si ou bezwen ed, kontakte nou nan support@bonid.ht
</p>
